                        <strong>HOW TO REACH</strong>
                        <br />
                        <br />
                        find information about&nbsp; - How to reach
                        <a href="https://www.indiacitytrip.com/Rajasthan-Destinations/udaipur.aspx">Udaipur</a><br /> <br />
                        
                        <b>By Train:</b> Udaipur is connected by train from major cities such as Ajmer, Chittrogarh, Delhi, Jaipur.  Palace On Wheels is a luxary train that goes to Udaipur.  The railway station of Udaipur is only 4 km from the heart of the city.<br />
                        
                        <b>By Air:</b> Udaipur has flights  to and from Mumbai, Ahemdabad, Aurangabad, New Delhi, Jaipur, Jodhpur. Udaipur airport is Dabok Airport, which is 21 km from the city centre. <br/>



<b>By Road:</b> The roads connections are good from  Ahmedabad, Ajmer, Indore, Kota,Delhi, Jaipur, Chittrogarh,  Mount Abu and Mumbai. Thus, there are bus services to and from Gujarat, Delhi and major cities of Rajasthan that end at the bus terminal, 2 km from the railway station <br />
                        
                        If you are travelling to Udaipur Rajasthan -  use <a href="https://www.indiacitytrip.com/Rajasthan-Destinations/Udaipur.aspx" target="_blank">Udaipur Rajasthan Trip Guide </a>.  You can also like Rajasthan India city trip page on facebook and get update.
